   "height": 113.75,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "• Stateless SSR containers scale out on RPS / CPU\n• ISR + revalidate-on-write: cached pages stay fresh\n  in seconds\n• Islands: minimal JS, hydrate only what is\n  interactive\n• AVIF / WebP + srcset cut image bytes by more than\n  half",
   "originalText": "• Stateless SSR containers scale out on RPS / CPU\n• ISR + revalidate-on-write: cached pages stay fresh\n  in seconds\n• Islands: minimal JS, hydrate only what is\n  interactive\n• AVIF / WebP + srcset cut image bytes by more than\n  half",
