   "strokeColor": "#e67700",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "Backend scaling strategy",
   "originalText": "Backend scaling strategy",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 7,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "g113"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1399399247,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 462242385,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "id": "t116",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2142,
   "y": 642,
   "width": 365.04,
   "height": 195,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "• Split by bounded context; each service scales on\n  its own signal\n• Booking is the write hot path: shard by listing_id\n  / region\n• No double-booking: Redis lock + DB optimistic\n  concurrency + idempotent payment\n• Outbox pattern: state change and event commit\n  atomically\n• Backpressure everywhere: queues, bulkheads,\n  circuit breakers, timeouts\n• Reads come from cache, replicas and search, not\n  the primary",
   "originalText": "• Split by bounded context; each service scales on\n  its own signal\n• Booking is the write hot path: shard by listing_id\n  / region\n• No double-booking: Redis lock + DB optimistic\n  concurrency + idempotent payment\n• Outbox pattern: state change and event commit\n  atomically\n• Backpressure everywhere: queues, bulkheads,\n  circuit breakers, timeouts\n• Reads come from cache, replicas and search, not\n  the primary",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
