   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "• Postgres: shard by region / listing_id; replicas × N per region\n• Redis cluster absorbs most reads; locks guard availability\n• S3 + CDN serve all media; lifecycle moves cold photos to infrequent access\n• Wide-column store takes chat / event writes: scale by adding nodes",
