   "id": "t231",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2142,
   "y": 1547,
   "width": 365.04,
   "height": 195,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "• Autoscale: HPA on RPS, KEDA on queue lag, cluster\n  autoscaler\n• Active-active regions; the traffic manager fails\n  over on health checks\n• Targets: RTO < 5 min, RPO < 1 min (sync replica +\n  PITR)\n• Cell-based isolation keeps a bad deploy or noisy\n  tenant local\n• Terraform gives identical regions and reproducible\n  DR\n• Canary + auto-rollback on SLO burn keeps releases\n  safe at scale",
   "originalText": "• Autoscale: HPA on RPS, KEDA on queue lag, cluster\n  autoscaler\n• Active-active regions; the traffic manager fails\n  over on health checks\n• Targets: RTO < 5 min, RPO < 1 min (sync replica +\n  PITR)\n• Cell-based isolation keeps a bad deploy or noisy\n  tenant local\n• Terraform gives identical regions and reproducible\n  DR\n• Canary + auto-rollback on SLO burn keeps releases\n  safe at scale",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
